\item   What is the percent dissociation of each reactant %64\%
\item   Calculate the equilibrium concentration of each reactant and product % $[\ce{Fe^{3+}}]$=0.018M; [\ce{SCN^{-}}]$=0.018M; [\ce{FeSCN^{2+}}]$=0.032M; 
